spans.s:
कल-त्र (त्रं) 1.
n. The hip and loins;
a wife; a royal citadel.

कल-ध्वनि (निः) 2.
m. The turtle dove;
cuckoo; peacock; low tone.

कालाप (पः) 1.
m. A serpent's hood;
a demon, a goblin.

कलि (लिः-ली) 1.
m. The iron age;
war; strife; an arrow; a hero;
myrobalan (लिः) (ली) 2. 3.
f. An
unblown flower.

कलि-कार (रः) 1.
m. Grey bonduc;
the forked tailed shrike;
Nā-
rada. (री)
f. Poisonous plant.

काल-याप (पः) 1.
m. Procrastination;
passing away time.
